    "description": "<p><b>Overview:</b><br/>Pet collar, nylon dog collar, cat collar<br/>Comfortable, durable, unlimited<br/>1. Open the plastic buckle<br/>2. Use the daily buckle to adjust the size of the collar to fit the size of the pet's neck.<br/>3. Use the lanyard to buckle and flatten the shoulder strap.<br/>4. Close the plastic buckle<br/>Applicable object: General for cats and dogs<br/><br/><b>Product information:</b><br/>Name: Soft nylon pet collar<br/>Color: red, rose red, pink, orange, green, black, blue, sky blue, purple<br/>Main fabric material: nylon<br/>Accessories: plastic buckle, metal D buckle, Japanese buckle, belt buckle<br/>Lining: Neoprene<br/>XXS: 1.0x (14-20 cm)<br/>XS: 1.0 times (22-35 cm)<br/>S: 1.5 times (27-43 cm)<br/>M: 2.0x (33-50 cm)<br/>Length: 2.5 times (36-56 cm)<br/>Material: imitation nylon<br/><br/><b>Neck circumference measurement method:</b><br/>Use a soft ruler to draw a circle on the widest part of the dog’s neck, and reserve 2-3cm around the dog’s neck, as shown in the figure.<br/><br/><b>Notes:</b><br/>Due to manual measurement, the actual size may vary by 1-2cm, please note<br/><br/><b>Packing list:</b><br/>Collar*1</p><p><style>\n<!--br\n{mso-data-placement:same-cell;\n}td\n{color:#000000;\nfont-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:宋体;\nfont-weight:400;\nfont-style:normal;\ntext-decoration:none;\ntext-align:general;\nvertical-align:middle;\nmso-number-format:General;\nmso-protection:locked visible;\n}.et2\n{color:#000000;\nfont-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:宋体;\nfont-weight:400;\nfont-style:normal;\ntext-decoration:none;\ntext-align:general;\nvertical-align:middle;\nmso-number-format:General;\nmso-protection:locked visible;\n}.et3\n{color:#000000;\nfont-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:宋体;\nfont-weight:400;\nfont-style:normal;\ntext-decoration:none;\ntext-align:general;\nvertical-align:middle;\nmso-number-format:'@';\nmso-protection:locked visible;\n}.et2\n{color:#000000;\nfont-size:12.0pt;\nfont-family:宋体;\nfont-weight:400;\nfont-style:norma